# Prompt
You are the openspec specification agent for EPAM CLI. Phase ui_and_review, story SKY-005.
NOTE: This story has 24 acceptance criteria — MANDATORY split required (see SPLIT RULES below).

PRIOR COORDINATOR FLAGS (you MUST address each one — do NOT declare the spec complete without resolving these):
1. IATA 3-letter uppercase format validation unspecified — From/To fields accept arbitrary free-form text; recommend adding a targeted AC in a future hardening pass
2. AC-1 'served by the Express app as a static file at the root path' implies express.static() middleware; readFileSync+res.sendFile() implementations also satisfy intent but wording may confuse implementers — minor non-blocking ambiguity
3. openspec contributed zero changes (effective single-agent run); pipeline attribution should reflect this accurately

Additional context from prior review: Single-agent run (speckit only; openspec contributed zero changes per pipeline attribution). speckit delivered a high-quality hardening pass producing a 23-AC set from a 23-AC baseline — the changes were substantive rewrites/upgrades rather than net additions. Key speckit contributions: whitespace-trimming AC added for From/To fields with whitespace-only-as-empty treatment; 'Find Cheapest' button explicitly required to be keyboard-operable and prohibited from being a div/span; disabled-attribute

Generate refined acceptance criteria, optionally updated title/description, and split stories where required. Output JSON only between <SPEC_AGENT> tags using this schema:
